From b352f01a915f26c5cb543b6e29e977f0ff64eb2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrian D'souza <adrdsouza@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 03:10:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] rightkit-service, rightkit-models: a process under test is
 refused the real per-user folder by default (RIGHTKIT_UNDER_TEST or a Cargo
 test binary); an override into the real folder is refused too. Uncompiled;
 held off main until the snapshot run completes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
