+- **Refused** with `SuiteError::UnderTest`: `Suite::resolve()` with none of `RIGHTKIT_SUITE_ROOT`, `RIGHT_SUITE_DIR`, `ORTHIC_SHARED_DIR` set (so the `HOME`, `XDG_DATA_HOME` or `LOCALAPPDATA` default); `Suite::per_user_default()` and `Suite::resolve_ignoring_env_overrides(true)`, always (they ignore every override on purpose, so use `Suite::at(<temp dir>)`, or set `RIGHTKIT_SUITE_ROOT` and use `Suite::resolve()`); and any override or `Suite::at(path)` that points into the real `<app data>/Orthic Labs` folder. Clients report it as `ERROR_SUITE_UNRESOLVED`.
+- **Never refused:** an override variable or `Suite::at(path)` outside the real folder, `Suite::per_run_temp`.
+- **Unaffected:** installed apps and `cargo run`. Test binaries and the examples in `examples/` count as tests, so a test that spawns an example and expects the real default now gets the refusal.
 
